{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:53:49+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-21T15:53:49+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Aedifica NV/SA","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Healthcare Facilities","country":"Belgium","city":"Brussels","website":"https://www.aedifica.eu","employees":127,"summary":"Aedifica NV/SA is a Belgian public regulated real estate company specializing in European healthcare real estate, particularly properties for elderly care. Aedifica has built a real estate portfolio worth approximately 12.5 billion euros in Belgium, Germany, the Netherlands, the United Kingdom, Finland, Ireland, Spain, France, and Italy. Since 2020, Aedifica has been a constituent of the BEL 20, the main stock market index of Euronext Brussels. Furthermore, since 2023, Aedifica has been included in the BEL ESG, the index that tracks the best-performing companies based on ESG criteria. Aedifica is also included in the EPRA, Stoxx Europe 600, and GPR indices. Its market capitalization was approximately 6.5 billion euros as of July 1st, 2026. Aedifica NV/SA was established on November 07, 2005 and incorporated in 2005 in Belgium.","exchange":"Brussels","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Aedifica NV/SA est une société immobilière réglementée publique belge spécialisée dans l'immobilier de santé européen, en particulier les propriétés pour les soins aux personnes âgées. Aedifica a construit un portefeuille immobilier d’environ 12,5 milliards d’euros en Belgique, en Allemagne, aux Pays-Bas, au Royaume-Uni, en Finlande, en Irlande, en Espagne, en France et en Italie. Depuis 2020, Aedifica fait partie du BEL 20, le principal indice boursier d’Euronext Bruxelles."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":5275284480,"shares_outstanding":83469689,"trailing_pe":6.294821,"forward_pe":11.404217,"price_to_book":0.8221566,"ev_to_ebitda":28.238,"ev_to_revenue":23.45